# Normalize line endings on commit. The 2026-07-30 home-restore rewrote the whole
# working tree LF -> CRLF, producing a 10k-line no-op diff across 72 files; this
# stops that class of churn from ever reaching a commit again.
* text=auto

# Keep the Linux-side shell/container files LF regardless of checkout platform.
*.sh    text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
